      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, main text",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u02bfI\u0307zzetlu\u0308 ve mu\u0308ru\u0308vvetlu\u0308 peder-i \u02bfazi\u0304zim h\u0323az\u0307retlerinin h\u0323uz\u0307u\u0304r-\u0131 s\u0327eri\u0304f[lerine],</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>deru\u0304n u\u0308zere sela\u0304mlar ve h\u032eay\u0131r du\u0304\u02bfa\u0304lar olunduk\u0323dan s\u0323on\u0303ra,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>fi\u0304-ma\u0304 ba\u02bfdehu: Benim peder-i \u02bfazi\u0304zim, bu def\u02bfa Muh\u0323ammed</p>\n<p>S\u0327a\u0304fi\u0304&lsquo;i\u0304 Bu\u0304la\u0304k\u0323i\u0304 ile u\u0308c\u0327 [yu\u0308z]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>k\u0323ant\u0323a\u0304r odun i\u0304rsa\u0304l olunmus\u0327dur, vus\u0323u\u0304lu\u0308nde ah\u032ez idu\u0308b,....</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Benim k\u0323ar\u0131ndas\u0327\u0131m, bu minva\u0304l u\u0308[zere ah\u032ez]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>idu\u0308b, ve defteriniz[e] [k\u0323ayd idu\u0308b]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ve vus\u0323u\u0304lu\u0308nde bildu\u0308re[siz] [&nbsp; &nbsp; ]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp; ] [ol] t\u0323arafda [&nbsp; &nbsp; ]</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
