      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, main text",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>To my noble and generous, most honoured, esteemed, noble, dear father, _____________________________</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>After heartfelt greetings and sincere prayers,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>now then: My dear father, this time, three [hundred] qint\u0323a\u0304rs of firewood were sent with Muh\u0323ammad Sha\u0304fi\u0304\u02bfi\u0304 Bu\u0304la\u0304qi\u0304.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When they arrive, take possession of them...</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My brother, in this m[anner take possession of them]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and [record it in] your register,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and inform me when they arrive [ ].</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp; ]there[&nbsp; &nbsp; ]</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
