          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, middle of the page",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>Muh\u0323ammad Sha\u0304fi\u0304\u02bfi\u0304 Bu\u0304la\u0304qi\u0304</p>\n</li>\n<li>[price] per [qint\u0323a\u0304r]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;firewood</li>\n<li>30 [pa\u0304ras?]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; qint\u0323a\u0304rs</li>\n<li>_________________________300</li>\n<li>[total:]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;9000</li>\n<li>shipping costs&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -528</li>\n<li>caique [?]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; --40</li>\n<li>in the [Sea of] Marmara [?]&nbsp; &nbsp;-75</li>\n<li>the tithe_________________-33 [one place torn away]</li>\n<li>[total:]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 99 [two places torn away]</li></ol>\n",
