      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>Ve benim peder-i [\u02bfazi\u0304zim], [&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;]</li>\n<li>ol t\u0323arafa keth\u032eu\u0308da\u0304 s[&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;]&nbsp;</li>\n<li>lut\u0323f idu\u0308b, bizim defterimiz... [&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;]</li>\n<li>mella\u0304h\u0323dan h\u032eala\u0304s\u0323 idesiz. Ve dah\u032ei</li>\n<li>mezku\u0304r ile bir a\u0304dam vard\u0131r, S\u0327eri\u0304f Yu\u0304suf</li>\n<li>dirler, mezku\u0304re yu\u0308z zer-i mah\u0323bu\u0304b altu\u0304n</li>\n<li>h\u0323ava\u0304le virilmis\u0327dir. Lut\u0323f idu\u0308b, bir gu\u0308n&nbsp;</li>\n<li>evvel mezku\u0304re yu\u0308z altu\u0304n viresiz,</li>\n<li>ba\u02bfi\u0304de gidecekdir. Lut\u0323f idu\u0308b&nbsp;</li></ol>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p></p>",
